  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Sensation 15 is the thickest and most durable version of the Sensation multifilament family. It uses highly elastic nylon fibers to provide comfort and vibration reduction, while two outer wraps applied in opposite directions improve structural durability. At 1.35 mm / 15 gauge, it prioritizes string life and stability over the extra power and feel of thinner Sensation gauges, making it particularly suitable for players who value arm-friendly comfort but frequently wear through multifilament strings.",

    "zh": "Wilson Sensation 15 是 Sensation 系列中最粗、同时也是最耐打的版本。它采用高弹性尼龙纤维来提供舒适性和减震效果，并通过两组反向缠绕的外层结构提升耐久和整体稳定性。1.35 毫米 / 15 Gauge 相比 Sensation 16 和 17 更强调寿命、稳定和抗断线能力，而力量、手感和旋转会略低一些。它特别适合希望保持 Arm-Friendly 多芯线手感，但又经常打断较细球线的玩家。"
  },

